      "message": "docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill lists set_raw_stock_only; PROCESS_VERSION 19\n\nThe skill's stock section gains the set_raw_stock_only row (one undo\nstep through SetStockSourceOnly; default off; the mark is ignored when\nthe model or its geometry no longer matches; an operation naming the\nmodel puts it back in the verdict; the post is refused when nothing is\nleft to judge).\n\nFixes #1106\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
